@customerToken = REPLACE_CUSTOMER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@adminToken = REPLACE_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@host = http://localhost:5173
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@orderId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@customerId = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

### Create order. RequestId becomes its ID; reuse it only to retry this exact order.
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{orderId}}",
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "shippingAddress": {
    "recipient": "Example Customer",
    "line1": "1 Example Street",
    "line2": null,
    "city": "Baku",
    "region": null,
    "postalCode": "AZ1000",
    "countryCode": "AZ"
  },
  "items": [{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 2 }]
}

### Current state and immutable price snapshots.
GET {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Customer orders.
GET {{host}}/api/orders?customerId={{customerId}}&pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Admin: confirm only after a successful Payment receipt is recorded.
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Ship confirmed order.
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "carrier": "Example carrier", "trackingNumber": "TRACK-001" }

### Mark shipped order delivered.
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Cancel before shipping (use on a different order to the delivered example).
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Customer requested cancellation" }

### Resume uncertain reserve/confirm/cancel operation.
POST {{host}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Readiness.
GET {{host}}/health/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
